{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.CompoundBetaShellCalibration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.CompoundBetaShellCalibration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.single_calibration_framework","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.single_calibration_framework","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L62-L67","doc":"**Single-calibration framework invariant.**\nThe framework uses only E_0 = 0.782 MeV as archimedean input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.compoundBetaYTarget","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.compoundBetaYTarget","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L54-L60","doc":"**y_target extraction.**\n`y_target = [Σ (chain) Q - Σ (non-magic) Q^(3)] / (E_0 · A_magic)` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.magicCrossingQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.magicCrossingQ","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L46-L52","doc":"The Q-value of a magic-crossing β-decay:\n`Q_beta = E_0 * (|tr_M(parent)| - |tr_M(daughter)| - |tr_M(e^- + \\bar\\nu)|)`.\nThe Q-value measures the difference of shell-operator contributions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.reference_E_0_MeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.reference_E_0_MeV","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L33-L34","doc":"The reference E_0 is exactly 0.782 MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.is_magic_crossing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.is_magic_crossing","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.chain_Q_MeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.chain_Q_MeV","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.A_magic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.A_magic","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaChain","kind":"structure","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.lean#L21-L31","doc":"**Compound β-decay chain data.**\n\nA β-decay chain through a magic shell consists of:\n- Chain Q-values from AME data\n- Identification of which steps cross the magic boundary\n- Non-magic Q-values predictable from level-3 shadow prices\n","signatureChunk":0}]}